lg:SE-SFS-2002-562-s8-q1-en
    a lgo:Translation ;
    lgo:reviewStatus lgv:Draft ;
    lgo:sourceTextSha256 "19b9050c8a8de8d72934278944f183031fbc6a42268c9448fc1374326deb663e" ;
    lgo:text """Section 8 When a service provider provides information society services, the provider shall give information about its name, its address in the state of establishment and its e-mail address and, where applicable,
1. its corporate identity number,
2. its VAT registration number, and
3. the competent licensing authority.
If a service provider carries on a regulated professional activity, the information shall also include details of
1. the professional title and the state in which it was obtained,
2. the professional body or similar organisation with which the service provider is registered, and
3. the rules that apply to the professional activity and how to access them."""@en ;
    lgo:translatedBy "claude-opus-5-5" ;
